":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Crime","Mystery"],"id":8865,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Deception","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk43/shows/3a3e273e-ed91-4c39-9c9d-f61b6a43745b.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk55/shows/8d0bf6d3-4809-473f-a97f-29ba87f9b25e.jpg","likes":46,"dislikes":1,"views":10029,"release_date":"1209081600000","length":6469,"description":"Cat and mouse. Jonathan McQuarry is an auditor in Manhattan, moving from office to office checking their books. While working late, a smooth and well-dressed man named Wyatt Bose chats Jonathan up, offers him a joint, and soon they're pals. When their cell phones are accidentally swapped, Jonathan answers Wyatt's phone to a series of women asking if he's free tonight. Jonathan discovers it's a sex club: busy powerful people meet each other anonymously in hotels. Jonathan falls for one of the club members, whom he knows only as \"S,\" whom he's also seen on a subway. When she goes missing, patterns emerge and Jonathan faces demands involving violence and lots of money.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.1}],"value":6.1,"age":"R"},"episode_id":8865,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}